# 🪙 Coin Game

A multiplayer browser game where you collect coins, upgrade your player, compete with others, and cause chaos.

## 🎮 Features

- 🌐 Online multiplayer
- 👤 Player accounts
- 🪙 In-game coin economy
- 🪙 Coinflip
- 🏪 Shop and permanent upgrades
- ⚔️ PvP
- 🏹 Crossbow
- 🛡️ Shield
- 😈 Troll Commands
- 🏆 Achievements
- 📊 Leaderboards
- 💬 Multiplayer chat
- 🛠️ Admin commands
- 🚫 Ban and mute system
- 🎉 Daily events

## 🪙 Economy

Coin Game uses an in-game currency called Coins.

Coins have no real-world monetary value and cannot be exchanged for real money.

Coins can be earned through gameplay and spent in the shop, coinflip, and other game features.

## 😈 Troll Commands

Troll Commands are special abilities that can be unlocked in the shop.

There are currently 15 Troll Commands.

Targets must have PvP enabled.

## 🏆 Achievements

Coin Game contains 50 achievements to unlock.

Some achievements are hidden.

## 🎉 Daily Events

A random event takes place every day at 15:00.

